---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /network-map.html
pageTitle: "CIPP Verified Installer Network Map"
pageDescription: "Interactive map of the CIPP Verified Installer network: every license-checked cured-in-place pipe contractor in the directory, the states they cover, and the territories still open to qualified contractors."
clickcease: false
---
{#-
  /network-map — Leaflet map of the Verified Installer network.
  Data: contractors.json (coverage) + states.json (regions) + mapPins.json (HQ coordinates).
  Shaded states = covered; striped = partly covered (an open region); light = open territory.
  Pins = CIPP Verified badge at each installer's home base.
-#}
{%- set hero_image = "/images/cipp/cipp-liner-equipment.jpg" -%}
{% include "partials/breadcrumb-css.njk" %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css?v={{ build.stamp }}">
<style>
  .nm-wrap { max-width: 1350px; }
  .nm-intro { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 28px; text-align: center; color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .nm-stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .nm-stat { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e9e9ef; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 22px; min-width: 150px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.04); }
  .nm-stat b { display: block; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: #1c1c24; font-weight: 700; }
  .nm-stat span { display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #777; font-weight: 600; }
  .nm-stat.is-open b { color: #fc9615; }

  .nm-map-shell { position: relative; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(12,24,44,.14); border: 1px solid #e3e6ee; background: #eef2f7; }
  #network-map { height: 620px; width: 100%; background: #e9eef5; }
  .nm-label { font: 700 11px/14px Poppins, sans-serif; color: #2b3a55; text-align: center; letter-spacing: .04em; text-shadow: 0 0 3px #fff, 0 0 3px #fff; pointer-events: none; }
  .leaflet-container { font-family: inherit; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { #network-map { height: 72vh; min-height: 420px; } }

  .nm-legend { position: absolute; left: 14px; bottom: 14px; z-index: 500; background: rgba(255,255,255,.95); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.12); }
  .nm-legend div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 3px 0; color: #333; }
  .nm-legend i { width: 18px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15); flex: 0 0 18px; }
  .nm-legend i.cov { background: rgba(29,59,110,.55); }
  .leaflet-control-attribution { font-size: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
  .nm-legend i.part { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29,59,110,.55) 0 4px, rgba(252,150,21,.55) 4px 8px); }
  .nm-legend i.open { background: rgba(252,150,21,.18); border-color: rgba(252,150,21,.7); }
  .nm-legend img { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  .nm-pin { width: 46px; height: 46px; margin-left: -23px !important; margin-top: -23px !important; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: transform .15s; cursor: pointer; }
  .nm-pin img { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; }
  .nm-pin:hover { transform: scale(1.12); }

  .leaflet-popup-content-wrapper { border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
  .leaflet-popup-content { margin: 16px 18px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; min-width: 230px; }
  .nm-card h4 { font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 2px; color: #1c1c24; line-height: 1.25; }
  .nm-card .nm-sub { color: #777; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .nm-card .nm-logo { max-height: 42px; max-width: 150px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; object-fit: contain; }
  .nm-card .nm-rating { color: #1c1c24; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .nm-card .nm-rating b { color: #fc9615; }
  .nm-card .nm-phone { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; }
  .nm-card .nm-phone a { color: #1c1c24; text-decoration: none; }
  .nm-card .nm-cta { font-size: 12px; color: #222; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .nm-card .nm-links a { display: inline-block; margin: 2px 10px 0 0; color: #1d3b6e; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 13px; }
  .nm-card.is-open h4 { color: #c66d00; }
  .nm-card .nm-apply { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; background: #fc9615; color: #fff !important; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: 13px; }
  .nm-card .nm-apply:hover { background: #e3850f; }

  .nm-lists { margin-top: 48px; }
  .nm-lists h3 { font-size: 22px; border-bottom: 2px solid #fc9615; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .nm-installer { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  .nm-installer img.badge { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: 0 0 34px; }
  .nm-installer .who { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .nm-installer .who a { font-weight: 700; color: #1c1c24; }
  .nm-installer .who small { display: block; color: #777; }
  .nm-installer .ph { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .nm-installer .ph a { color: #1c1c24; }
  .nm-open-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  .nm-open-grid a { display: block; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1.5px solid #fc9615; background: #fff7ec; border-radius: 8px; color: #1c1c24; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
  .nm-open-grid a:hover { background: #fc9615; color: #fff; }
  .nm-card .nm-contractor { margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 12px; color: #777; }
  .nm-card .nm-contractor a { color: #1d3b6e; font-weight: 600; }
  .nm-customer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; background: #fff7ec; border: 2px solid #fc9615; border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 30px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .nm-customer > div { flex: 1 1 420px; }
  .nm-customer h3 { border: 0; margin: 0 0 6px; padding: 0; font-size: 22px; }
  .nm-customer p { margin: 0; color: #444; max-width: 640px; }
  .nm-customer a.btn-orange, .nm-recruit a.btn-orange { display: inline-block; background: #fc9615; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .nm-customer a.btn-orange:hover, .nm-recruit a.btn-orange:hover { background: #e3850f; }
  .nm-recruit { background: #1c1c24; color: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 30px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .nm-recruit h3 { color: #fff; border: 0; margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 24px; }
  .nm-recruit p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); margin: 0 0 14px; max-width: 760px; }
  .nm-recruit a.btn-orange { display: inline-block; background: #fc9615; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; }
  .nm-recruit a.btn-orange:hover { background: #e3850f; }
</style>

<div class="breatcumb-area d-flex align-items-center">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-12">
        <div class="breatcumb-content text-center">
          <div class="breatcumb-title"><h1>CIPP Verified Installer Network Map</h1></div>
          <div class="breatcumb-content-text">
            <ul><li><a href="/">home</a> <i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i> <span>Network Map</span></li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="blog_area style-two pt-5 pb-5">
  <div class="container nm-wrap">
    <p class="nm-intro">Every badge on this map is a cured-in-place pipe contractor whose license, work history and lining equipment we checked before listing them. Shaded states have a verified installer; the lighter ones are territories still open to a contractor who meets the program's standards.</p>

    <div class="nm-stats" id="nm-stats" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="nm-stat"><b data-stat="installers">–</b><span>Verified installers</span></div>
      <div class="nm-stat"><b data-stat="covered">–</b><span>States covered</span></div>
      <div class="nm-stat is-open"><b data-stat="open">–</b><span>Open territories</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="nm-map-shell">
      <div id="network-map" role="application" aria-label="Map of CIPP Verified Installers across the United States"></div>
      <div class="nm-legend" aria-hidden="true">
        <div><img src="/images/cipp/cipp-verified-badge.webp" alt=""> Verified installer home base</div>
        <div><i class="cov"></i> State with a verified installer</div>
        <div><i class="part"></i> Partly covered — a region is open</div>
        <div><i class="open"></i> Open territory — now recruiting</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row nm-lists">
      <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
        <h3>In the network</h3>
        <div id="nm-installer-list"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
        <h3>Open territories</h3>
        <p style="color:#666; font-size:14px;">No verified installer here yet. Tap a state: property owners can request a contractor, and qualified CIPP contractors (5+ years, 4.5+ Google rating) can apply to be listed for the territory.</p>
        <div class="nm-open-grid" id="nm-open-list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="nm-customer">
      <div>
        <h3>Don't see a verified installer near you?</h3>
        <p>Tell us where the property is and what the pipe is doing. We will locate a qualified cured-in-place pipe contractor who works your area and have them contact you for a camera inspection and a written estimate.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-orange" href="/find-a-contractor">Find me a contractor</a>
    </div>

    <div class="nm-recruit">
      <h3>Run a CIPP crew in an open state?</h3>
      <p>The Verified Installer program places one qualified cured-in-place pipe contractor in each open territory. To prequalify you need at least five years in business and a Google rating of 4.5 or better. From there we verify your license, your lining work and your equipment, and if you pass you are listed on this map and on every city page in your territory with your own phone number.</p>
      <a class="btn-orange" href="/apply">Apply to be listed</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{#- Data for the map, built from the site's data files at build time. -#}
<script type="application/json" id="nm-data">
{
  "states": {{ states | dump | safe }},
  "contractors": [
  {%- for c in contractors -%}
    {%- if mapPins[c.slug] -%}
      {%- set pin = mapPins[c.slug] %}
      {
        "slug": {{ c.slug | dump | safe }},
        "name": {{ (c.shortName or c.name) | dump | safe }},
        "url": {{ ("/contractor/" + c.slug) | dump | safe }},
        "website": {{ (c.website or "") | dump | safe }},
        "phone": {{ (c.phone or "") | dump | safe }},
        "logo": {{ (c.logo or "") | dump | safe }},
        "rating": {{ (c.googleRating or "") | dump | safe }},
        "reviews": {{ (c.googleReviewCount or 0) | dump | safe }},
        "place": {{ (pin.placeLabel or "") | dump | safe }},
        "lat": {{ pin.lat }}, "lng": {{ pin.lng }},
        "coverage": [{% for cov in c.coverage %}{{ (cov.state or "") | dump | safe }}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]
      },
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor %}
    null
  ]
}
</script>
<script src="/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js?v={{ build.stamp }}" defer></script>
<script src="/vendor/topojson-client.min.js?v={{ build.stamp }}" defer></script>
<script src="/js/network-map.js?v={{ build.stamp }}" defer></script>
